1
00:00:00,876 --> 00:00:02,906
(Leonard:)It's also a problem
because we don't even know

2
00:00:02,911 --> 00:00:04,681
(Leonard:)if the aliens
who find this can see.

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,880
(Leonard:)I mean, they might
communicate

4
00:00:05,881 --> 00:00:07,581
(Leonard:)in a totally
different way than us.

5
00:00:07,583 --> 00:00:09,613
(Raj:)Like when my dog is mad at me,

6
00:00:09,618 --> 00:00:12,418
(Raj:)she tells me
by peeing in my slippers.

7
00:00:12,421 --> 00:00:15,961
(Leonard:)That's actually a valid example.

8
00:00:15,958 --> 00:00:18,658
(Leonard:)Animals do deliver messages
through scent.

9
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,360
(Raj:)Bees talk to each other
by dancing.

10
00:00:20,362 --> 00:00:21,562
(Raj:)Whales have their songs.

11
00:00:21,563 --> 00:00:24,163
Penny has about 20 different
ways of rolling her eyes

12
00:00:24,166 --> 00:00:26,366
(Leonard:)that each mean
something different.

13
00:00:26,368 --> 00:00:28,768
(Raj:)Okay, so, what it
sounds like is,

14
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,170
(Raj:)what we want is a device

15
00:00:30,172 --> 00:00:32,272
(Raj:)that can deliver a message
through not only sight,

16
00:00:32,274 --> 00:00:33,744
(Raj:)but other senses, as well.

17
00:00:33,742 --> 00:00:36,812
(Leonard:)The most basic sense that any
space-faring civilization

18
00:00:36,812 --> 00:00:38,912
(Leonard:)would have to possess is touch.

19
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:40,984
Ooh. Ooh, ooh!

20
00:00:40,983 --> 00:00:43,213
(Raj:)We could make
a video-playing device

21
00:00:43,218 --> 00:00:45,288
(Raj:)that simultaneously translates
the information

22
00:00:45,287 --> 00:00:47,017
(Raj:)into a tactile medium.

23
00:00:47,022 --> 00:00:49,622
(Leonard:)All we have to do is rig up
a 3-D communication system!

24
00:00:49,625 --> 00:00:50,795
We-we can totally do that!

25
00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:52,462
I know!
This is great!

26
00:00:52,461 --> 00:00:53,591
(Leonard:)Yeah, you know what else it is?
What?

27
00:00:53,595 --> 00:00:55,265
(Howard:)Exactly what Sheldon
and Howard said.

28
00:00:57,765 --> 00:01:05,025
(Raj:)Well, thank you
for peeing in my slippers.

